<title>UK: Banco Cidade sets $50 mln eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Cidade sets $50 mln eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Cidade SA has launched a $50 million eight-year step-up bond, lead manager Credit Agricole Indosuez said.</p>
<p>The bond will have put and calls in years three and five.</p>
<p>The issue will be priced later today. -- London Newsroom  +44 171 542 7970</p>
</text>
